<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Thursday at the</p>
<p>$675,000 Legg Mason Tennis Classic (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Michael Joyce (U.S.) 4-6 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>2-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat 16-Fernon Wibier</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) beat 5-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 3-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2) 7-6 ((7-1)</p>
<p>7-Scott Draper (Australia) beat Steve Campbell (U.S.) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7)</p>
<p>11-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Luke Smith (Australia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1) 6-2</p>
<p>14-Vince Spadea (U.S.) beat Michael Tebbutt (Australia) 5-7</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 6-3</p>
